t URL and Git blob hash.","endpointComparison":"The five declaration type headers and four project definition bodies are compared to the submission after dropping comments and collapsing runs of whitespace. Exact definition digests cover the full source range without its terminal LF. The fifth definition is read from each pinned Mathlib. Dependency chains, elaboration, and type equivalence are outside this source check."}}
